====== Senao/EnGenius ESR-6650 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

Built by Senao Networks, this router is made to serve as a 3G gateway. It is sold under many names, including EnGenius ESR-6650 and Encore ENHWI-3GN3.

  * First trunk support [[https://dev.openwrt.org/changeset/29603|r29603]] (ESR-9753 image)
  * The ESR9753 build of 14.07 (Barrier Breaker) runs well, but has very little JFFS2 space available (340kb).
    * https://downloads.openwrt.org/barrier_breaker/14.07/ramips/rt305x/openwrt-ramips-rt305x-esr-9753-squashfs-sysupgrade.bin
  * If you want room to install packages, I recommend the ESR9753 build of 12.09 (Attitude Adjustment).
    * https://downloads.openwrt.org/attitude_adjustment/12.09/ramips/rt305x/openwrt-ramips-rt305x-esr-9753-squashfs-sysupgrade.bin

